:"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/LambCalculus.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.LambCalculus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.LambCalculus","kind":"structure","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/LambCalculus.lean#L22-L43","doc":"**A Lamb calculus** over the scalar ring `F`, on the `F`-module `V` of vector fields.\n`good u` restricts the Lamb identity to the fields for which the instance proves it\n(for example, fields with differentiable coordinate slices). ","signatureChunk":0}]}